  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 719.02 Required Reporting and Public Notice",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 719.02 Required Reporting and Public Notice.\n\n(a) An O/O shall submit all monitoring data and other required information as specified in this part.\n\n(b) An O/O shall provide public notice as specified in Env-Dw 800.\n\nSource. #9701, eff 5-1-10; ss by #12669, eff 1-1-19",
